  communicate_image_data: ?r - object ?l - object ?o - object ?m - object ?x - object ?y - object
      pre: (and (at ?r ?x) (at_lander ?l ?y) (available ?r) (channel_free ?l) (have_image ?r ?o ?m) (lander ?l) (mode ?m) (objective ?o) (rover ?r) (visible ?x ?y) (waypoint ?x) (waypoint ?y))
