  communicate_rock_data: ?r - object ?l - object ?p - object ?x - object ?y - object
      pre: (and (at ?r ?x) (at_lander ?l ?y) (available ?r) (channel_free ?l) (have_rock_analysis ?r ?p) (lander ?l) (rover ?r) (visible ?x ?y) (waypoint ?p) (waypoint ?x) (waypoint ?y))
